# The pattern the Session and song traces (S9+) start from: seven scenes
# (slots 1-7) on three tracks, a bar each, stopped, at 240 BPM, 25 s at
# 44,118 Hz. Track 1 has a clip in every scene; track 2 in scenes 1, 3, 5
# and 7; track 3 in 2, 4 and 6. tests/test_seq_ui.py plays it with Test Sine.
#! rate=44118 block=64 tracks=8 end=1102950
